    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02591",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "子孙繁昌，瓜瓞绵绵。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Its descendants prosper and multiply, continuing on like an endless vine of melons.",
          "g": "predicate"
