      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02591",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "添造华屋，三轩四轩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Splendid houses are added one after another, three halls and four halls more.",
